    <section class="hero" id="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-left">
          <h1>Debug Your App Locally From Anywhere. Instantly</h1>
          <p class="hero-support">Support for macOS, Linux, and Windows</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-right">
          <p class="hero-desc">Wing tunnels your local development environment to a shareable link with no deployment all in real time, straight from your machine.</p>
          <div class="command-box">
            <span class="prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
            <code>curl -fsSL https://example.com/install | sh</code>
            <div class="copy-btn" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Copy command">
