    <!-- How It Works -->
    <section class="how" id="how">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>How It Works.</h2>
        <p class="how-desc">Wing works in the background so you don't have to think about it. Run one command, get a link, share it. Your app stays on your machine, wing just makes it accessible to everyone else.</p>

        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-top">
              <h3>Run</h3>
              <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M8 5.5v13l11-6.5z" /></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
            <p>Wing starts a tunnel from your local server to our relay. One command and you're done.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-top">
              <h3>Share</h3>
              <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path d="M3.5 12h17M12 3a14.5 14.5 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 18" /></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
            <p>Wing generates a unique link tied to your session. Share the link wherever you communicate.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-top">
              <h3>Preview</h3>
              <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="m9 7-5 5 5 5M15 7l5 5-5 5" /></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
            <p>No account needed, no install required. Whoever has the link opens it in their browser and sees your app running live.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-top">
              <h3>Debug</h3>
              <span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="4.5" /><circle cx="12" cy="6.5" r="2" /><path d="M10.5 5.2 8 2.8M13.5 5.2 16 2.8M7.5 10.5l-3.2-2M7.5 15.5l-3.2 2M16.5 10.5l3.2-2M16.5 15.5l3.2 2" /></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
            <p>Make a change, save the file. It reflects on their end instantly. Real collaboration, zero friction.</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="demo-link-wrap">
